<main class="support-page">
  <section class="support-shell">
    <a class="back-link" href="/nesting">Back to Kenzap Nesting</a>
    <div class="eyebrow">Support</div>
    <h1>Support and FAQ for Kenzap Nesting App</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      Use this page for Kenzap Nesting App questions, bug reports, installation help, export issues,
      and general usage support.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="card-label">Best for quick help</div>
        <div class="card-title">Email support</div>
        <p>
          Use the form below or email <a href="mailto:support@kenzap.com">support@kenzap.com</a>.
          For Nesting App issues, include your operating system, app version, and a short description
          of what happened.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-card accent">
        <div class="card-label">Open source app</div>
        <div class="card-title">Nesting App notes</div>
        <p>
          Kenzap Nesting App currently runs locally and does not send your DXF files or job data to
          Kenzap. If you report a bug, only send files or screenshots if you want us to review them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <div class="section-label">Frequently asked questions</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details open>
          <summary>Does Kenzap Nesting App send my DXF files to the cloud?</summary>
          <p>
            No. The app is intended to run locally on your machine. It currently does not collect
            analytics, upload DXF files, or transmit nesting job data to Kenzap.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What should I include when reporting a Nesting App issue?</summary>
          <p>
            The most useful report includes your operating system, app version, a short sequence of
            steps, what you expected, what happened instead, and whether the problem is reproducible.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What should I include if export or nesting results look wrong?</summary>
          <p>
            Include a short description of the expected result, what you saw instead, your platform,
            app version, and whether the issue happens with one file or many. If you are comfortable
            sharing a sample DXF, mention that in your message.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you publish user questions?</summary>
          <p>
            Only if you explicitly give permission. The support form includes an optional checkbox
            that lets you allow publication of your question in edited FAQ form.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Where should I report an open-source Nesting App bug?</summary>
          <p>
            You can email support or open an issue on
            <a href="https://github.com/kenzap/nesting-app/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
            If the issue includes sensitive files, email is usually the safer option.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

      <section class="form-section">
        <div class="section-label">Ask a question</div>
      <form
        name="nesting-support"
        method="POST"
        data-netlify="true"
        data-netlify-recaptcha="true"
        netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
        action="/thank-you"
        class="support-form"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="nesting-support" />
        <input type="hidden" name="product" value="Kenzap Nesting App" />
        <p class="honeypot">
          <label>
            Do not fill this out:
            <input name="bot-field" />
          </label>
        </p>
        <div class="field-grid">
          <label>
            <span>Name</span>
            <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Email</span>
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label>
          <span>Environment or version</span>
          <input
            type="text"
            name="environment"
            placeholder="Example: Windows 11, Nesting App v0.4.2, Apple Silicon..."
          />
        </label>

        <label>
          <span>Your question</span>
          <textarea
            name="message"
            rows="8"
            placeholder="Describe the issue, question, or request. For bugs, include steps to reproduce if possible."
            required
          ></textarea>
        </label>

        <label class="checkbox-row">
          <input type="checkbox" name="publishConsent" value="yes" />
          <span>I give permission for Kenzap to publish this question in edited FAQ form without personal details.</span>
        </label>

        <div class="captcha-wrap" data-netlify-recaptcha="true"></div>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send request →</button>
          <div class="form-note">
            Your message is submitted through Netlify Forms. If the form is unavailable, email
            <a href="mailto:support@kenzap.com">support@kenzap.com</a> directly.
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>

